w.com/en/india-cjp-leader-abhijeet-dipke-released-after-detention/a-79690933--80500fd3a662.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-cjp-leader-abhijeet-dipke-released-after-detention/a-79690933?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two other prominent CJP leaders are set to be released on Sunday. India has seen huge rallies calling on the country's top election official to step down over alleged manipulation of voter rolls.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Kolkata stampede dampens Durga Puja festivities</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:40641d09edada5268a1819c8d69b6b3d03cd80f510fa2c4493335dcf902dd661</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T04:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-kolkata-stampede-dampens-durga-puja-festivities/live-79685143--9e78a7d0cccd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-kolkata-stampede-dampens-durga-puja-festivities/live-79685143?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities have detained several people over a deadly stampede in India's eastern city of Kolkata, after the state vowed strict action. Meanwhile, 'Cockroach' leader Dipke is out of detention. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Canada: Fire at military base in Alberta leaves four dead</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:76cf6ded28bf38ddaa0dfef34fa2270b91d3859a5e9cbe8252b0474166271dce</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:44:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T02:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/canada-fire-at-military-base-in-alberta-leaves-four-dead/a-79690515--0a63cf2c4195.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/canada-fire-at-military-base-in-alberta-leaves-four-dead/a-79690515?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney said a "serious incident" sparked a major fire at a military base in Alberta.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'No Kings' rallies push early voting ahead of US midterm elections</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f8596f0b23d651e76b0510c8ae24ab4cad212391849db896e4fb5671dde57308</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/no-kings-rallies-push-early-voting-ahead-of-us-midterm-elections/a-79690502--c2c75c7f5f7c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/no-kings-rallies-push-early-voting-ahead-of-us-midterm-elections/a-79690502?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Organizers of the "No Kings" protests, known for their anti-Trump sentiment, are urging Americans to vote early in the November 3 midterm elections, as Republicans face tough races to retain control of Congress.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ilhan Omar: The US Democrat targeted by Donald Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f73dc3f27ed854dd59f67859a89024d347396cbc5cdfa5fd49c9f2ed8750bc3</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T19:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445--0b2fbb5ba398.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump has described her as "garbage" and a "criminal" who does nothing but "bitch." Congress member Ilhan Omar has long been the target of angry verbal attacks from the US president. But why her?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Romanian fighter jets shoot down 2 drones over Black Sea</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:edd901cdfe08922ad369d45d44242af0152098337c355ab1b40bb1a104247a9d</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T17:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/romanian-fighter-jets-shoot-down-2-drones-over-black-sea/a-79689156--bd62b985e5d3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/romanian-fighter-jets-shoot-down-2-drones-over-black-sea/a-79689156?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Romanian Air Force F-16s shot down drones over Romanian territorial waters. Earlier this week, two chemical tankers were hit by drones near Romania's Black Sea coast.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Egypt's Ssisi says he'll defend Saudi Arabia, if asked</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c12e6414b0238a0e498e74a75a07c0c4563bbdc07d31afd3fdd2e519f3f68579</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T17:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/egypt-s-ssisi-says-he-ll-defend-saudi-arabia-if-asked/a-79689105--a11b59189924.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/egypt-s-ssisi-says-he-ll-defend-saudi-arabia-if-asked/a-79689105?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Egyptian president said his country was ready to defend Saudi Arabia "if requested." The comments come amid escalating Houthi attacks.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>West Bank: Israeli settlers attack EU diplomats, French mayor</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:24a10d3d431c6ba48d4f170a1f94e0d37c195dc60934508db09fd98140a2f7b1</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T16:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/west-bank-israeli-settlers-attack-eu-diplomats-french-mayor/a-79688819--13df4c5f717b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/west-bank-israeli-settlers-attack-eu-diplomats-french-mayor/a-79688819?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A group of Israeli settlers attacked vehicles carrying European diplomats in the West Bank, a day after an American photographer was beaten. Belgium and France have condemned the attack.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How big is Russia's threat against Germany?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:662b32d8ba39f834f0bb4c5637c746b96988aaeb1cd6b41a4397d7ee76695f3a</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T15:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-big-is-russia-s-threat-against-germany/a-79688426--e8db9669a70a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-big-is-russia-s-threat-against-germany/a-79688426?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Experts believe that, so far, Germany has been ill-prepared — both militarily and mentally — for Russian provocations. They also warn against the idea that ending support for Ukraine would make Germany safer.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>China's influence in the gaming industry is growing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dde3abb0b99299d2b1d2a9387714d3581718379939af01081fa8b67aa7bc3b65</id><updated>2026-10-18T18:43:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T14:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755--447380e7608a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Home to more than 700 million gamers, China is the world's largest gaming market — but it's also one of the most tightly regulated. The effects reach far beyond China, impacting players around the world.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
